- I considered roughly 25-40 documents across HRW, Amnesty, CPJ, Reuters syndications, Turkish official legal pages, and a few broader background items.
- I kept sources that added distinct value on one of four themes: custody abuse/impunity, domestic violence protection failures, LGBT/protest policing, and selective legal punishment or crisis response.
