- The Istanbul blast source gives crisis-response context, but not a full independent investigation of proportionality, legality, or follow-up accountability.
- If you want a finer 3B dossier, the next best gain would come from Turkish-language legal reporting on protest bans, custody abuse, and women’s-protection enforcement in late 2022.

